# Every out-of-tree build directory, not two of them by name. build-rel/ and build-full/ are already
# in use (the flatpak manifest skips them), build-client/ and build-server/ get created by hand, and
# none of them were covered - so a plain "git add -A" would happily commit a whole CMake tree, which
# is how the 825 files under build-server/ got into the repository.
build*/
out/
